{"ID":"20240220132619-2g2r0bs","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132619-2g2r0bs","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132619-2g2r0bs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164244-zhc7627\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164244-3bjgyva\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:263,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164244-3bjgyva\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:53,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:53\u0026#125;","title":"【旋覆花代赭石汤】（旋覆代赭石汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164244-zhc7627","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-zhc7627","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百七十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-dkkx7o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-dkkx7o3","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,发汗,若吐,若下,解后心下痞鞕,噫气不除者,「旋覆代赭石汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-rg6si5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-rg6si5e","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不一定非得伤寒，发汗吐下才会有这个症状。平常正常人也会有这种病。心下痞鞕就是胃里面很硬，胀焖很难过。噫气不除就是有胃酸，「旋覆代赭石汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-um9tdb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-um9tdb4","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个方剂我用的非常多，几乎所有病人呢，我看他上面写着胃酸（可能是西医病历），台湾也叫火烧心，那时胃酸已经伤到喉咙食道了，「旋覆代赭石汤」一剂下去，胃就很舒服，如果不舒服，好掉一点，还是有胃酸逆流的现象，那就是食道喷门破洞了，太久了。我们还有处方治疗，那如果没有破洞，一剂下去就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-rr97dvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-rr97dvo","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"现代人得到胃酸就是甜食吃太多了，现在人工糖造成胃酸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你治好他，告诉他甜食不能吃。真正的天然的糖做成的甜食可以吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-f18l60j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-f18l60j","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自然界甘味是土，现在科技造出来，吃到嘴里是甘的，到胃里是酸的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-m82gz9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-m82gz9w","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆代赭石汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-sq8vpju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-sq8vpju","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"旋覆花三两。人参二两。生姜五两切。代赭石一两。大枣十二枚劈。甘草三两炙。半夏半斤洗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-odrq8uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-odrq8uf","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味,以水一斗,煮取六升,去滓,再煎,取三升,温服一升,日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-maz0th3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-maz0th3","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"旋覆花三钱，重用。代赭石一钱，代赭石是金石类的药。旋覆花，对治浓痰在里面，代赭石降逆，噫气打嗝，胃酸往上走。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-cnoz5av","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-cnoz5av","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人很重的时候，旋覆花可以用到四钱，代赭石用到两钱三钱四钱上去没关系。你只要记得，代赭石是要降逆的，所以如果病人告诉你气一直往上升，冲上来很难过，代赭石加重两钱三钱加上去没关系，这些都是没有毒可以吃的。遇到人参生姜大枣甘草就是补肠胃的津液，滋阴用的，代表这个人已经肠胃的津液伤到了。在发汗的时候都会伤到肠胃的津液。所以治病的同时把津液补回去。半夏是止呕的，但是半夏一定主胃周围旁边的水。胃里面有水的时候靠生姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-z66r5pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-z66r5pr","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜泻心汤为什么会有食臭，因为他胃里面有水，食物泡水里面，两三天就会臭，就是食臭，这个时候用生姜泻心汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164244-3bjgyva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164244-3bjgyva","updated":"20240312164244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痰、酸很多，重用旋覆花。如果说气一直往上冲，酸往上冲，代赭石多一点，三钱四钱五钱没关系。这些都是没有毒的。"}]}]}